<section id="Vloxx">
    <h2>Vloxx</h2>
    <p>
        Vloxx wields Ancora, an ancient seer staff used to ascend people mortals into powerful beings.
        Vloxx has used the staff to ascend himself to gain the power to 'fix' Tyria.
    </p>
    <div>
        <h3>All phases</h3>
        <p>
            Vloxx uses these skills in every phase of the fight.
        </p>
        <div class="vloxx-skill">
            <h4>Probability Distribution</h4>
            <p>
                Several people will be targeted with orange circles. 
                After a few seconds they drop on the ground, then explode after another second.
                They leave behind puddles, so try to take them away from the boss.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="vloxx-skill">
            <h4>Judgement of Eternity</h4>
            <p>
                Vloxx targets several people with a 3 person green.
                Do not stack the greens.
                If you do not have a green, go find someone with a green to stand with.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="vloxx-skill">
            <h4>Surrounding Curse</h4>
            <p>
                Vloxx bombards the area with several magic orbs, each exploding where they land.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="vloxx-skill">
            <h4>Ascension's Sacrifice</h4>
            <p>
                Vloxx chains several people to himself, lifting them up. Each of the chained people get a 2 person green.
                If the green is not resolved, the lifted player gets slammed on the ground and loses all of their boons.
            </p>
        </div>

        <h3>Phase 1 (100 -> 70%)</h3>
        <p>
            The first time you face Vloxx, he will be weilding the staff form of Ancora.
        </p>
        <div class="vloxx-skill">
            <h4>Annihilating Orb</h4>
            <p>
                Vloxx casts a large bubble that moves along a designated path.
                When it reaches the end of the path, Vloxx teleports to the location, creating a shockwave.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="vloxx-skill">
            <h4>Eternal Reflection</h4>
            <p>
                Vloxx shoots out a fan of magic orbs. When an orb hits a target, it reflects off and explodes nearby.
                <!--will projectile destruction work for this?-->
            </p>
        </div>
        <h3>Phase 2 (70 -> 40%)</h3>
        <p>
            After finishing the 2nd set of Visions, Vloxx will be wielding Ancora as a spear.
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Thousand Strikes</li>
            <li>Cosmic Charge</li>
            <li>World Piercer</li>
            <li>Raging Storm</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Phase 3 (40 -> 10%)</h3>
        <p>
            Starting when you finish the last set of Visions, Vloxx wields the legendary sword Wages of Stars.
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Excision Extremis</li>
            <li>Division Eternal</li>
            <li>Echoing Blade</li>
            <li>Slice Through Reality</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Phase 4 (10 -> 0%)</h3>
        <p>
            When Vloxx reaches 10% hp, he will teleport to the center of the stage and leave the suit, rising above the stage.
        </p>
    </div>
    
</section>
